# Yuriko, Blade of the Mighty bars casting spells and activating abilities in combat, but foretelling is a special action,
# not an activated ability (CR 116.2h, 602.5): in Bot1's turn 3 beginning of combat, with Yuriko on the battlefield, Bot1
# pays {2} with two Moxen (mana abilities) and Delayed Blast Fireball goes to exile foretold. The step check shows it was
# done in combat, not in a later step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Yuriko, Blade of the Mighty
Delayed Blast Fireball
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Yuriko, Blade of the Mighty.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Delayed Blast Fireball.Foretell
? Step = BeginCombat
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Exile.FaceDown = Delayed Blast Fireball

[Expect]
Exile.FaceDown = Delayed Blast Fireball
